---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms of Use | FormFix India" description="Terms of use for FormFix India: tools are provided as-is, results are not a guarantee of application acceptance, and users remain responsible for checking official requirements.">
<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Terms of Use</h1>
<p class="text-slate-600 mt-2 max-w-2xl">Free tools, used as-is. Please read the two points below before you submit anything.</p>
<div class="space-y-4 mt-6">
  <article class="card p-5 md:p-6"><p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">📄</p><h2 class="font-bold text-lg mt-2">As-is, no guarantee</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Tools are provided free and as-is, without a guarantee that any output will be accepted by any application authority. You are responsible for checking the latest official requirements for your own form, for the clarity and correctness of your documents, and for not submitting a document you do not have the right to submit. Do not use the rasterize mode on a signed or legally significant document without checking with the issuing authority.</p></article>
  <article class="card p-5 md:p-6"><p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🏢</p><h2 class="font-bold text-lg mt-2">Business details</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Business and legal details for this site are not published on this page yet.</p></article>
</div>
</Base>
